<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="PHM" style="id">- Thur MARKED</book>
  <para style="h">Pilemon</para>
  <para style="toc1">Pilemon</para>
  <para style="toc2">Pilemon</para>
  <para style="toc3">Pilemon</para>
  <para style="mt2">Waraga na Paulo öcöö both</para>
  <para style="mt1">Pilemon</para>
  <para style="imt">Köp na tye ï waraga ka Paulo both Pilemon</para>
  <para style="ip">Pilemon onwongo obedo Akiricito n'oywek rwök, nen calö ën onwongo obedo ngat acël ï kin jö n'oye Kiricito na tye ï Kolocai ëka obedo ngat n'onwongo tye k'opii mërë na nyïngë Onecimo. Opii ni onwongo öngwëcö ökö kï both adwong mërë ëka ën obino örwatërë kï Paulo, n'onwongo tye ï buc. Paulo obino ömïö Onecimo ödökö Akiricito.</para>
  <para style="ip">Waraga ka Paulo both Pilemon obedo kwac both Pilemon më rïbö watgï gïn k'opii mërë, na Paulo tye ka oro cen yo bothe ëka öjöl ën pathï na calö opii n'ëtïmö kïca këkën ëntö na calö omego n'obedo Akiricito.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="PHM 1" />
  <para style="s">Moth n'öya kï both Paulo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PHM 1:1" />Waraga ni öya kï both Paulo, n'obedo amabuc ka Kiricito Yecu, ëka Timoteo ömïn onu,</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PHM 1:1" />
  <para style="p" vid="PHM 1:1">Both Pilemon okone onu më amara ëka atic awodh onu, <verse eid="PHM 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PHM 1:2" />kï jö n'oye Kiricito na cökërë ï odi gïn k'amïn onu Apia, ëka both Arikipo acikari awodh onu:<verse eid="PHM 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PHM 1:3" />Obanga Apap onu ëka Rwoth onu Yecu Kiricito ömïïwu gum ëka kuc.<verse eid="PHM 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mar ka Pilemon ëka yee mërë</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PHM 1:4" />An apwöyö Obangana ï karë kïbëc kite na an apo piri ï lëgana, <verse eid="PHM 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PHM 1:5" />pïën an atye ka winyo köp ï kom marni pï jö k'Obanga na leng kïbëc ëka yeeni ï kom Rwoth Yecu. <verse eid="PHM 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PHM 1:6" />Kite na in itye ka nywakö yeeni kï jö nökënë ï gürë kanya acël, an alëgö nï ëk ïnïang na thuth ï kom gin na bër kïbëc na onu etye ködë ï Kiricito. <verse eid="PHM 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PHM 1:7" />Marni ömïa yom cwiny na thwönë rwök ëka thon öcükö cwinya, pïën in, ömëra, ikweo cwiny jö k'Obanga na leng.<verse eid="PHM 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kwac ka Paulo pï Onecimo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PHM 1:8" />Pï manön, kadï bed nï an atye kï tëk cwiny ï Kiricito na mïö an aciki më tio gin mörö na mïtërë, <verse eid="PHM 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PHM 1:9" />ëntö pï mar, an anënö nï bër akwai. An Paulo, na bedo ngat n'otii ëka kobedini thon abedo amabuc pï Kiricito Yecu, <verse eid="PHM 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PHM 1:10" />an akwai pï athïn-na Onecimo, na an adökö apap mërë nakun onwongo an atye ï buc kany. <verse eid="PHM 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PHM 1:11" />Ï karë n'opoth ën onwongo ba tye kï köny mörö bothi, ëntö kobedini ën dong tye kï köny na thwönë rwök bothi ëka botha.<verse eid="PHM 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PHM 1:12" />An atye ka oro ën cen yo bothi—na ën obedo dhö cwinya kikome. <verse eid="PHM 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PHM 1:13" />An onwongo amïtö nï agwök ën botha kany, ëk ömïa köny na kakari nakun pod atye ï buc pï tïtö köp më Emuth na Bër. <verse eid="PHM 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PHM 1:14" />Ëntö an onwongo ba amïtö nï atïm gin mörö nakun in ba iyeo, ëk bërni kür obed na calö gin mörö n'edii adïa ïë, ëntö obed kite na in iyeo ködë. <verse eid="PHM 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PHM 1:15" />Gwök onyo gin n'ömïö ën opokere kodi pï karë na nönök onwongo obedo nï ëk ïgam ën yo bothi dong na twal— <verse eid="PHM 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PHM 1:16" />pathï dökï na calö opii, ëntö na löö opii ökö, na calö omego më amara. Ën pïrë tëk botha ëntö pïrë tëk bothi rwök na calö dhanö na konyi ëka na calö omeru ï Rwoth.<verse eid="PHM 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PHM 1:17" />Pï manön, ka in ingeo nï an abedo atic awodhi, jöl ën kite na in onwongo ïtwërö jölöna ködë. <verse eid="PHM 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PHM 1:18" />Ka cë ën ötïmö gin mörö na rac bothi, onyo tye kï banyani mörö, kwan-gï ï wia. <verse eid="PHM 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="PHM 1:19" />An, Paulo, ënë acöö waraga ni kï cïnga. An abino cülöni—nakun an ba akobo nï in thon itye kï banyana, ën kwöni kikome. <verse eid="PHM 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PHM 1:20" />Eyo, ömëra, an amïtö köny mörö kï bothi ï Rwoth. Kwe cwinya ï Kiricito. <verse eid="PHM 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="PHM 1:21" />An atye kï gen na tëk ï komi nï in ibino winyo dhöga, ënë ömïö an acöö nini köp ni nakun angeo nï ibino tïmö na löö gin na an akwaö.<verse eid="PHM 1:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PHM 1:22" />Gin acël nökënë: Yüb nïna kabedo mörö na an abino bedo ïë, pïën an atye kï gen nï lëgawu bino mïö ëgönya më dwogo yo bothwu.<verse eid="PHM 1:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PHM 1:23" />Epapira, amabuc awodha ï Kiricito Yecu, omothowu. <verse eid="PHM 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="PHM 1:24" />Marako, Aricitako, Dema ëka Luka etic ewodha thon omothowu.<verse eid="PHM 1:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PHM 1:25" />Kïca ka Rwoth Yecu Kiricito obed kodwu.<verse eid="PHM 1:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PHM 1" />
</usx>